# Phase 3: Data Preprocessing

## Overview
This phase prepares captured network traffic data for analysis by cleaning and organizing it.

## Objectives
- Import packet data.
- Clean and preprocess data.
- Extract important network features.

## Tasks Completed
- Imported data into Python
- Removed missing values
- Cleaned duplicate records
- Extracted packet information
- Structured data using Pandas

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy

## Outcome
Prepared a clean and structured dataset for network traffic analysis.
